    "text": "Boudicca was a heroic queen of Britain. Her people were the Iceni. They lived in the southeast of the island. The Romans broke the priest center on the isle of Anglesey. After the loss of her husband and the ruin of her own family, she rose. She called on the war goddess Andraste at her last hour. The revolt did not hold. Defeated, she ended her own life.",
